; =====================================================
; FILE: fortress
; PURPOSE:
;   Builds fortresses, defenses, Fortress units, and Fortress-owned techs.
;
; =====================================================
; *** Table of Contents *** 
; =====================================================
;
;	Chapter 0: SETUP
;	Chapter 1: FORTRESS TECHS
;	Chapter 2: UNIQUE UNITS
